      .col-xxl-5.col-xl-6.col-12.pb-8.order-1.order-xl-0
        .theme-wizard.theme-wizard-progress(data-theme-wizard='data-theme-wizard' data-create-board='data-create-board')
          .mt-6.border-bottom-0
            p.mb-0.text-800
              | Step: 
              span(data-kanban-step='data-kanban-step') 1
            ul.nav.justify-content-between.nav-wizard.nav-wizard-progress
              li.nav-item
                a.nav-link.active.fw-semi-bold(href='#create-board-tab1' data-bs-toggle='tab' data-wizard-step='1')
              li.nav-item
                a.nav-link.fw-semi-bold(href='#create-board-tab2' data-bs-toggle='tab' data-wizard-step='2')
              li.nav-item
                a.nav-link.fw-semi-bold(href='#create-board-tab3' data-bs-toggle='tab' data-wizard-step='3')
              li.nav-item
                a.nav-link.fw-semi-bold(href='#create-board-tab4' data-bs-toggle='tab' data-wizard-step='4')
              li.nav-item
                a.nav-link.fw-semi-bold(href='#create-board-tab5' data-bs-toggle='tab' data-wizard-step='5')
          .mt-6
            .pt-4.pb-0
              .tab-content
                #create-board-tab1.tab-pane.active(role='tabpanel' aria-labelledby='create-board-tab1')
                  p.mb-4
                    | This will be the 
                    b Name
                    |  and description of your Kanban board. You and other admins can edit the name in future. The name can contain letters, numbers &amp; punctuation.
                  form#createBoardForm1(novalidate='novalidate' data-wizard-form='1')
                    .form-floating
                      input#create-boardwizard-name.form-control(type='text' name='create-board-name' placeholder='Event title' value='New Kanban Board')
                      label(for='create-boardwizard-name') BOARD NAME
                    .form-floating.mt-4
                      select#create-boardwizard-type.form-select(name='create-board-type')
                        option(selected='selected' disabled='disabled' value='') Select event type
                        option(value='1') technical
                        option(value='2') external
                        option(value='3') organizational
                      label(for='create-boardwizard-type') BOARD TYPE
                    .form-floating.mt-4
                      textarea#create-board-wizard-des.form-control(placeholder='Leave a comment here' name='create-board-message' style='height: 128px')
                      label(for='create-board-wizard-des') DESCRIPTION (OPTIONAL)
                #create-board-tab2.tab-pane(role='tabpanel' aria-labelledby='create-board-tab2')
                  p.mb-4
                    | These will be the 
                    b Columns
                    |  of your Kanban board. They represent discrete stages in work process. Columns can be Edited, Removed, Rearranged or Added in future.
